{"2822570":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Sector YAMA","steam_appid":2822570,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sci-fi action-RTS set on an alien planet at the outskirts of known space.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A previously docile alien species has suddenly begun to attack a newly established human outpost. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as one of the conscript soldiers tasked with the guarding of the outpost and try to survive the alien attack and to escape with your life.  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather the troops, upgrade your equipment, explore the planet, and find a way to escape!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-= Sector YAMA Features =-<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Command troops in real-time combat with dozens of units on screen<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Explore the map to find new allies, resources, and secrets<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Capture production points<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Destroy enemy bases<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Participate in an epic space-opera story<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Ultra-casual controls - can play with a single gamepad stick!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Play as Soldier - who was abandoned by the military command on an alien planet and who has to take the command in his own hands to escape the war and save his life<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-= Gameplay mechanics  =-<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Allied troops will automatically follow the player and attack enemies in range. The player's primary job is to gather a large force of allied troops, and then defeat enemy troops by tactically balancing his own position in a way that protects his allies from harm while also keeping himself alive.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game length: 3+ hours<\/p>